    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Executes a two-venue round trip and returns the proceeds to the immutable owner.\\n\\n`profit_asset` is 0 for USDC and 1 for BLND. Venues are 0 for Comet,\\n1 for Aquarius, and 2 for Soroswap. The call rolls back unless the\\nmeasured output is strictly greater than `amount + minimum_profit`.",
